 our most thoughtful work. It combines Vue.js components and plugins, while looking like everything fits together. For an easy start or inspiration for you project, we have also create a set of example pages, like the user settings or usage graphics."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/creativetimofficial/ct-vue-light-bootstrap-dashboard-pro/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"c4fc661008162b4b95969b4ef82613523cef2971086fa865b3d3f055f310de5f","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T05:59:17.844Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T20:34:24.310Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2022-12-05T09:22:52Z","overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T14:54:15.343Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Vue Light Bootstrap Dashboard PRO is a beautiful resource built over Bootstrap and Vue. It will help you get started developing dashboards in no time.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/creativetimofficial/ct-vue-light-bootstrap-dashboard-pro/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"c4fc661008162b4b95969b4ef82613523cef2971086fa865b3d3f055f310de5f","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/creativetimofficial/ct-vue-light-bootstrap-dashboard-pro/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T20:34:24.310Z"},"readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/creativetimofficial/ct-vue-light-bootstrap-dashboard-pro/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T20:34:24.310Z","hash":"c4fc661008162b4b95969b4ef82613523cef2971086fa865b3d3f055f310de5f","originalBytes":9372,"storedBytes":9372,"truncated":false},"qualityPriority":false,"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T18:12:25.924Z","latestRelease":{"name":"v1.4.2","tag":"1.4.2","publishedAt":"2022-12-05T09:22:53Z","url":"https://github.com/creativetimofficial/ct-vue-light-bootstrap-dashboard-pro/releases/tag/1.4.2"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T18:12:25.924Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/8310e0e392be7c0f1edf7a1f.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-19T12:18:18.541Z","url":"http://vuejs.cr